The '''Wizards' Guild''', located in [[Yanille]], contains a number of useful resources for those interested in [[Magic|Magic.]] You must have level 66 Magic to enter. [[Temporary skill boost#Magic|Boosts]], such as a [[wizard's mind bomb]] at level 63, can be used to enter. Entering the Wizards' Guild is a task in the [[Hard Ardougne Diary]].

==Transportation==
Besides walking, there are several fast-transport means to the area near Yanille:
*[[Watchtower teleport|Watchtower Teleport]] places you in the Watchtower just outside the city walls, or just north of the hunter shop if you've completed the Hard [[Ardougne Diary]].
*[[Teleport to House]] (if your [[player-owned house]] is in Yanille).
*A [[Yanille teleport|redirected]] [[house tablet]] to Yanille.
*[[Fairy ring]] code {{fairycode|CIQ}} places you a bit north of the city's western gate.
*A [[Castle Wars|ring of dueling]] can teleport you to [[Castle Wars]], which is just west of Yanille.
*[[Minigame teleport|Minigame Teleport]] to the [[Nightmare Zone]].
*[[Ardougne cloak]] which teleports you to the [[Ardougne Monastery]] just north of Yanille

==Features==
==={{FloorText|uk=0|caps=y|nohelp=y}}===
[[File:Wizards' Guild.png|300px|thumb|The ground floor of the guild.]]
*[[Zavistic Rarve]] - The guild grand secretary. He is involved in a number of quests such as [[The Hand in the Sand]] and [[Zogre Flesh Eaters]]. If you cannot get in to talk to him, you can ring the [[Bell (Wizards' Guild)|bell]] just outside the door to call him. He wears special robes that make him stand out.
*[[Wizard Distentor]] - Will teleport you to the [[rune essence]] mine. He is the closest one to a [[bank]] when compared to other NPCs capable of teleporting you to the mine. He wears lighter blue robes than other wizards, helping him stand out.
*[[Professor Imblewyn]] - A gnome professor studying magic. He is featured in the [[Gnome Restaurant]] mini-game.
*2 attackable [[wizard]]s.

==={{FloorText|uk=1|caps=y|nohelp=y}}===
The {{FloorNumber|uk=1}} includes two shops and three attackable [[wizard]]s.
====Magic Guild Store (Mystic Robes)====
{{main|Magic Guild Store - Mystic Robes}}
[[Wizard Sinina]] sells a variety of mystic equipment. He also sells the [[Magic cape]] for 99,000 coins to players with level 99 Magic.

