==={{FloorText|uk=2|caps=y|nohelp=y}}===
[[File:Magic Guild portal.gif|thumb|right|200px|A portal on the top floor.]]
The {{FloorNumber|uk=2}} contains three magical portals.

*The [[Wizards' Tower Portal|east portal]] teleports to the [[Wizards' Tower]] (south of [[Draynor Village]]).
*The [[Dark Wizards' Tower Portal|south portal]] teleports to the [[Dark Wizards' Tower]] (west of [[Falador]]).
*The [[Sorcerer's Tower Portal|west portal]] teleports to [[Thormac]]'s [[Sorcerer's Tower]] (south of [[Seers' Village]]).

The portals are one-way teleportation devices. There are no portals at the destinations to return players to the Wizards' Guild.

3 attackable [[wizard]]s can also be found here.

===Basement===
*8 level 24 [[Zombie (common)|zombies]] in a locked cage. It may be a useful training spot, but you will have to use [[telekinetic grab|Telekinetic Grab]] to pick up anything that they drop.
*[[Wizard Frumscone]] - The creator of the "magic zombies." He gives you permission to kill the zombies, and is also involved in the [[Swan Song]] quest.

